[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5241869509","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122250#issuecomment-5241869509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122250","id":5241869509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOHCUxQ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T14:46:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T14:46:51Z","body":"I added the performance label because the main purpose of this is for performance https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15352\r\n\r\nThis needs profile results of each mode, otherwise how will we know it fixes the issue at all?\r\nThe issue might be talking about editing text near underlines in which case this wouldn't help at all and other places that deal with underlines would need to be optimized.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5241869509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5241901265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122250#issuecomment-5241901265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122250","id":5241901265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOHEQ0Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T14:49:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T14:50:13Z","body":"That should be measured before added and that wasn't the main point highlighted in the PR, I don't think this makes sense as a primary performance PR (we don't use \"performance\" for things that just generally improve performance or handle performance in edge cases etc.)\r\n\r\nIf the performance cost of the underlines is a general concern that should be investigated I'd say. I don't see how it would be unless there's some obvious error in the code for it, so I don't think turning them off is the proper solution if that is the case","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5241901265/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5242408237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122250#issuecomment-5242408237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122250","id":5242408237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOHjNLQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T15:32:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T15:32:19Z","body":"Thank you for the comments! While my work on this PR was sparked by the issue on the proposals repo that kitbdev and I linked, which stated issues about performance, my hope was that this would not _solely_ be a \"performance-fixing\" PR. Rather, it'd add a little bit more functionality and customization to the existing underline functionality, and some of those options would also be able to provide better performance. 🙂 \r\n\r\nI've not done profiling of Godot before, so today I am hoping to set that up and analyze the drawing procedure for the script editor to see where it spends most of its time drawing. Hopefully with that, I'll be able to find a particular area to focus in on. [As Mickeon said before, the squiggles really don't seem like they should be _that_ harsh on a computer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15352#issuecomment-5232879006), so maybe there will be further optimization we can do there. We'll see...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5242408237/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5242429171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122250#issuecomment-5242429171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122250","id":5242429171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOHke8w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T15:34:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T15:34:09Z","body":"I think the configurability is the relevant focus here and a valuable feature on its own, if performance is the primary concern then it should only be merged if the performance issue cannot be resolved on its own","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5242429171/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5243541765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122250#issuecomment-5243541765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122250","id":5243541765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOIoZBQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T17:15:06Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T17:15:06Z","body":"As noted [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15352#issuecomment-5243043620), `canvas_item_add_polyline()` appears to be the main culprit for making the squiggle algorithm take longer. I'll see what I can find about potentially viable alternatives such as `canvas_item_add_mesh()`, but for now the options provided in this PR provide good alternatives that improve performance if the squiggle algorithm is too heavy.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5243541765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]